@VigiaPlatform_HostAddress = http://localhost:5125

### 1. Register a new Vehicle (without GPS initially)
POST {{VigiaPlatform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "COMP-001",
  "licensePlate": "ABC-123",
  "brand": "Volvo",
  "model": "FH16",
  "maxCapacityTons": 32.5
}

### 2. Register a new Vehicle (with GPS paired)
POST {{VigiaPlatform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "COMP-001",
  "licensePlate": "XYZ-789",
  "brand": "Scania",
  "model": "R500",
  "maxCapacityTons": 28.0,
  "gpsDeviceId": "GPS-TRK-002"
}

### 3. Get all Vehicles
GET {{VigiaPlatform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vehicles
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get Vehicles filtered by GPS pairing status (paired = true)
GET {{VigiaPlatform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vehicles?isGpsPaired=true
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Vehicles filtered by GPS pairing status (paired = false)
GET {{VigiaPlatform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vehicles?isGpsPaired=false
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Vehicle by ID
GET {{VigiaPlatform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vehicles/1
Accept: application/json

### 7. Pair a GPS device to a Vehicle (1:1)
POST {{VigiaPlatform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vehicles/1/gps-device
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gpsDeviceId": "GPS-TRK-001"
}

### 8. Update Vehicle real-time WGS84 position
POST {{VigiaPlatform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vehicles/1/position
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": -12.046374,
  "longitude": -77.042793
}

### 9. Define a Warehouse Geofence
POST {{VigiaPlatform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/geofences
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "COMP-001",
  "siteId": "WH-LIMA-01",
  "name": "Almacén Central Callao",
  "type": "WAREHOUSE",
  "centerPoint": {
    "latitude": -12.056000,
    "longitude": -77.118000
  },
  "radiusMeters": 250.0
}

### 10. Define a Job Site Geofence
POST {{VigiaPlatform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/geofences
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "COMP-001",
  "siteId": "SITE-MIRAFLORES-01",
  "name": "Obra Torre Miraflores",
  "type": "JOB_SITE",
  "centerPoint": {
    "latitude": -12.119000,
    "longitude": -77.030000
  },
  "radiusMeters": 150.0
}

### 11. Get all Geofences
GET {{VigiaPlatform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/geofences
Accept: application/json

### 12. Get Geofences filtered by type (WAREHOUSE or JOB_SITE)
GET {{VigiaPlatform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/geofences?type=WAREHOUSE
Accept: application/json

### 13. Get Geofences filtered by type JOB_SITE
GET {{VigiaPlatform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/geofences?type=JOB_SITE
Accept: application/json

### 14. Get Geofence by ID
GET {{VigiaPlatform_HostAddress}}/api/v1/geofences/1
Accept: application/json
